on:underline\"><em>The Understanding between Foxes and Light</em></span></a><em> and in an alternate form in </em><a href=\"https://bottlecap.press/products/collision\"><em>A Collision of Soul in Midair</em></a></p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1686391456174_8803 {\n    \n    \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1686391456174_8803 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1686391456174_8803 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1686391456174_8803 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1686391456174_8803 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-yui_3_17_2_1_1686391456174_8803 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1686391456174_8803 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n    \n  </style>\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/a9032d95-ba0b-473e-a531-82cdd71f9f84_789/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/a9032d95-ba0b-473e-a531-82cdd71f9f84_789/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"4b40063ab78f692d2c34\" id=\"block-4b40063ab78f692d2c34\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><h4 style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Prelude: To the Islands I have Known</h4><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">An island can weep as intensely as any man<br>and wear a beard in the wrong places.<br><br>The color white is impossible, or at least soundless.<br>An island walked through this, weeping.<br><br>As the city of Philadelphia unfolded<br>into an origami fish in the rearview mirror,<br>the heart stayed where the blood is.<br><br>An island leaves a hole where it once was,&nbsp;<br>dreaming of large things that could fall into it.<br>Blood is always either moving or not moving,<br>they call this the patience of the dead.<br><br>An island forgets to breathe sometimes,<br>you can hear this if you stand still for long enough.</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-4b40063ab78f692d2c34 {\n    \n    \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-4b40063ab78f692d2c34 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-4b40063ab78f692d2c34 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-4b40063ab78f692d2c34 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-4b40063ab78f692d2c34 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-4b40063ab78f692d2c34 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-4b40063ab78f692d2c34 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n    \n  </style>\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>",
  "excerpt": "As the city of Philadelphia unfolded / into an origami fish in the rearview mirror, / the heart stayed where the blood is."
}
